{"unit_id": "tag:01NY:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），它表示上面定义的函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>为泛对象（object）。\n若<MATH_0005>，则可以考虑四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0006>。它确定了典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0007>（在<MATH_0008>上）。按构造，此态射（morphism）对应于上面定义的函子（functors）之间的变换<MATH_0009>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n对每个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>，令<MATH_0011>，则有一个典范（canonical）的等同，将基变换（base change）<MATH_0012>与<MATH_0013>中相应的开子概形（open subscheme）等同起来，见引理<REF_0001>。此外，上面构造的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0014>对应于<MATH_0015>中开集（opens）之间的包含映射（inclusions）。因此，<MATH_0016>是开浸入（open immersion）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n由此可构造<MATH_0017>，方法是将概形（schemes）<MATH_0018>沿开浸入（open immersions）<MATH_0019>粘合（glueing）。技术上，为方便起见，可选取一个序列（sequence）<MATH_0020>，使每个正整数（positive integer）都整除其中一个<MATH_0021>，然后直接取<MATH_0022>，这里使用上面的开浸入（open immersions）。接下来容易证明<MATH_0023>表示函子（functor）<MATH_0024>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "inclusions", "target_term": "包含映射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列"}, {"source_term": "positive integer", "target_term": "正整数"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示前述函子的概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "前面定义的函子"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "所取的泛对象"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "决定典范态射的四元组"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "由四元组确定的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与函子间的变换对应的态射"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "发生变换的函子"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "任取的仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "修饰基变换与开子概形之间的等同"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "与开子概形等同的基变换"}, {"source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形", "context": "基变换所对应的开子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "先前构造的态射"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "发生包含关系的开集"}, {"source_term": "inclusions", "target_term": "包含映射", "context": "开集之间的包含映射"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "对构造出的态射所得的结论"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "沿开浸入粘合的概形"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "粘合所沿的开浸入"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "从这些概形得到整体的构造"}, {"source_term": "sequence", "target_term": "序列", "context": "满足整除条件的序列"}, {"source_term": "positive integer", "target_term": "正整数", "context": "整除条件量化的对象"}, {"source_term": "open immersions", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "取所给对象时使用的开浸入"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "最终得到表示的函子"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NZ:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>下，引理中构造的概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>（见引理<REF_0002>）与表示函子（functor）<MATH_0002>的概形（scheme），作为概形（schemes）在<MATH_0003>上典范同构（canonically isomorphic）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonically isomorphic", "target_term": "典范同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中构造的概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "第二个概形所表示的函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示所给函子的概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "比较同构时所在的相对范畴中的对象"}, {"source_term": "canonically isomorphic", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "两个概形在给定基底上的同构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NZ:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），它表示函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。注意，<MATH_0003>是一个概形（scheme），它在<MATH_0004>上，因为函子（functor）<MATH_0005>带有自然变换（natural transformation）<MATH_0006>。记<MATH_0007>。我们须证明<MATH_0008>作为<MATH_0009>上的概形（schemes）成立。下面给出两种论证。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第一种论证使用如下构造：将<MATH_0010>构造为若干概形（schemes）<MATH_0011>的并，这些概形表示<MATH_0012>，见引理<REF_0001>的证明。在<MATH_0013>的每个仿射开集（affine open）上，可将<MATH_0014>与<MATH_0015>在该开集上的截面（sections）所成的齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum）等同，因为对开集（opens）<MATH_0016>已是如此。此外，这些等同与进一步限制到更小的仿射开集（affine opens）相容。另一方面，<MATH_0017>由粘合（glueing）这些齐次谱（homogeneous spectra）构造而成。因此，可以将这些同构（isomorphisms）粘合成所需的同构（isomorphism），即<MATH_0018>与<MATH_0019>之间的同构。细节从略。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n下面是第二种论证。引理<REF_0002>表明，存在一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>，它是<MATH_0021>上的分次代数（algebras）之间的态射，在<MATH_0022>的仿射开集（affine opens）上的截面（sections）上与（<REF_0003>）一致。因此，对每个<MATH_0023>，都存在一个开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0024>，它是<MATH_0025>的邻域，并存在一个整数（integer）<MATH_0026>，使得对<MATH_0027>，层（sheaf）<MATH_0028>是可逆的（invertible），且乘法映射（maps）<MATH_0029>都是同构（isomorphisms）。于是，将<MATH_0030>限制到层（sheaf）<MATH_0031>，得到<MATH_0032>中的一个元素（element）。由于开集（opens）<MATH_0033>覆盖<MATH_0034>，可见“<MATH_0035>”给出<MATH_0036>中的一个元素（element）。从而得到典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0037>（在<MATH_0038>上）。因为这个构造完全是典范的（canonical），为证明它是同构（isomorphism），可以在<MATH_0039>上作局部验证。于是归结为<MATH_0040>是仿射的（affine）的情形，此时结论是清楚的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "natural transformation", "target_term": "自然变换"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectra", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示首个函子的概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由该概形表示的函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "在指定基底上的概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "带有自然变换的函子"}, {"source_term": "natural transformation", "target_term": "自然变换", "context": "赋予表示概形基底结构的自然变换"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所需同构作为相对概形成立"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "取并的各个表示概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "作局部识别的开集"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "在该仿射开集上的截面"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "该开集上截面所成的