{"unit_id": "tag:01O0:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为由分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）构成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的相对齐次谱（relative homogeneous spectrum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，或称<TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0006>在<MATH_0007>上的齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，或称<TEXTITOPEN_0003><MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>上的相对射影谱（relative Proj）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，是引理<REF_0001>中构造的概形（scheme），它表示函子（functor）<MATH_0010>（<REF_0002>），见引理<REF_0003>。记为<MATH_0011>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "定义所用的基概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰构成层的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "构成所给层的分次代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "定义相对齐次谱所给的层"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱", "context": "定义的第一个名称"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱", "context": "定义的第二个名称"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱", "context": "定义的第三个名称"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中构造的表示概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由所定义的概形表示的函子"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01NS:prose-0004", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n相对射影谱（relative Proj）带有一个由按<MATH_0001>分次（graded）的代数（algebras）构成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0002>（结构层（structure sheaf）的扭转（twists）），以及一个“泛（universal）”分次（graded）代数（algebras）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0001>。也可将其视为同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0004>。下面的引理表述了这个对象（object）的泛性质（universality）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "twists", "target_term": "扭转"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "universality", "target_term": "泛性质"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱", "context": "带有所述层和同态的相对构造"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "按所给指标分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "构成拟凝聚层的代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "相对射影谱所带的层"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层", "context": "被扭转的层"}, {"source_term": "twists", "target_term": "扭转", "context": "结构层的各次扭转"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛", "context": "引号内修饰同态的词"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰同态两端的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "所给同态的两端"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "随相对射影谱给出的泛同态"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "同一同态的另一种表述"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": 