{"unit_id": "tag:01O1:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>下，设<MATH_0001>为四元组（quadruple）。设<MATH_0002>为相应的<MATH_0003>-态射（morphism）。\n存在一个按<MATH_0004>分次（graded）的<MATH_0005>-代数（algebras）之间的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，使下列图表（diagram）交换（commutes）<MATH_0007>。\n这一图表（diagram）的交换性（commutativity）唯一确定<MATH_0008>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "commutativity", "target_term": "交换性"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "引理所给的输入"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "与四元组关联的态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "按所给指标分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "作为同构两端的分次代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由图表交换性唯一确定的同构"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "要求交换的图表"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "对该图表提出的条件"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表", "context": "其交换性给出唯一性的图表"}, {"source_term": "commutativity", "target_term": "交换性", "context": "唯一确定所给同构的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O1:proof", "translation": "注意，四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0001>定义了<MATH_0002>的一个元素（element）。设<MATH_0003>为满足下述条件的点集（locus）：层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>是可逆的（invertible），且由<MATH_0005>的像（image）生成（generated）。\n回顾<MATH_0006>表示函子（functor）<MATH_0007>，见引理<REF_0001>的证明。因此，只要证明四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0008>是泛族（universal family），即<MATH_0009>中的表示对象（object），结论即得。\n可先限制到<MATH_0010>的一个仿射开集（affine open）再证明这一点，理由是（甲）函子（functors）<MATH_0011>的构造与基变换（base change）交换（commutes）（见引理<REF_0002>），且（乙）二元组（pair）<MATH_0012>是在<MATH_0013>的仿射开集（affine opens）上粘合（glueing）而成的（见引理<REF_0003>）。\n于是可设<MATH_0014>是仿射的（affine）。此时，四元组（quadruples）函子（functor）<MATH_0015>与三元组（triples）函子（functor）<MATH_0016>一致（见引理<REF_0004>的证明）。此外，引理<REF_0005>表明，<MATH_0017>是<MATH_0018>上的泛三元组（universal triple）。\n沿引理<REF_0006>证明中的各个等同关系逆推，可见<MATH_0019>正是所求的泛四元组（universal quadruple）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "locus", "target_term": "点集"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "universal family", "target_term": "泛族"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "quadruples", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "universal triple", "target_term": "泛三元组"}, {"source_term": "universal quadruple", "target_term": "泛四元组"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "定义所给元素的四元组"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素", "context": "由四元组定义的元素"}, {"source_term": "locus", "target_term": "点集", "context": "由层的可逆性与生成条件确定的所在处"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "在该点集上可逆且由指定像生成的层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的", "context": "所给层在指定点集上的性质"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "生成所给层的像"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "所给像对层的生成关系"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "先前引理证明可表示的函子"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "需要证明为泛族的四元组"}, {"source_term": "universal family", "target_term": "泛族", "context": "作为表示对象的族"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象", "context": "充当泛族的表示对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "可先限制到的开集"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "其构造与基变换交换的函子"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "与函子构造交换的操作"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "函子构造与基变换之间的关系"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "在仿射开集上粘合得到的一对对象"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "粘合所用的开集"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "得到该二元组的构造"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "限制到开集后可作的假设"}, {"source_term": "quadruples", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "第一个函子分类的对象"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "四元组给出的函子"}, {"source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组", "context": "第二个函子分类的对象"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "三元组给出的函子"}, {"source_term": "universal triple", "target_term": "泛三元组", "context": "引理确定的泛