{"unit_id": "tag:01O2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002>是由分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）构成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是分离的（separated）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给的基概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰构成层的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "构成所给层的分次代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "引理假设所给的层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理断言为分离的态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "所断言的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O2:proof", "translation": "要证明一个态射（morphism）是分离的（separated），可以在基底（base）上局部进行，见《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节。按构造，<MATH_0001>在任意仿射（affine）的<MATH_0002>上与<MATH_0003>同构（isomorphic），其中<MATH_0004>。由引理<REF_0002>可知，<MATH_0005>是分离的（separated）。因此，<MATH_0006>是分离的（separated）（见《概形（Schemes）》的引理<REF_0003>），这正是所要证明的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "要判断分离性的对象"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "可在基底上局部验证的性质"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "基底", "context": "局部验证所在的基底"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引章节的章名"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "修饰任取的局部基概形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "构造在任意所给仿射部分上的识别"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "前一引理推出的局部分离性"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离的", "context": "由局部结果得到的分离性"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所引引理所在的章名"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O3:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），<MATH_0002>为由分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebras）构成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。设<MATH_0004>为概形（schemes）之间的任意态射（morphism）。则存在典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0005>，以及相应的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0006>，后者的两端是按<MATH_0007>分次（graded）的<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "假设给定的基概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰构成所给层的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "构成拟凝聚层的分次代数"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "用来构造相对射影谱的层"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "任给态射的两端"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "在引理中任取的态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "引理所给的第一个同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "与典范同构相应的代数同构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰第二个同构两端的代数"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第二个同构的两端"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O3:proof", "translation": "这由引理<REF_0001>以及<MATH_0001>在引理<REF_0002>中的构造得出。在该构造中，取概形（schemes）<MATH_0002>的并（union），这些概形表示函子（functors）<MATH_0003>。\n从相对射影谱（relative Proj）的粘合（glueing）构造来看，这个同构（isomorphism）由引理<REF_0003>中构造的同构（isomorphisms）给出，该引理也给出同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0004>。部分细节从略。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "先前构造中取并的表示概形"}, {"source_term": "union", "target_term": "并", "context": "用各表示概形构造整体的运算"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由取并前的概形表示的函子"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱", "context": "通过粘合得到的相对构造"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "粘合", "context": "构造相对射影谱的方式"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "正在证明的第一个同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所引引理中构造的局部同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "所引引理给出的另一同构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O4:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为由分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-模（modules）构成的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），它作为<MATH_0004>-代数（algebra）由<MATH_0005>生成（generated）。\n在这种情形下，概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>表示函子（functor）<MATH_0007>。该函子把概形（scheme）<MATH_0008>（在<MATH_0009>上）对应到二元组（pairs）<MATH_0010>的集合（set），其中\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0011>是可逆的（invertible）<MATH_0012>-模（module），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0013>是分次（graded）<MATH_0014>-代数同态（algebra homomorphism），使得<MATH_0015>是满射（surjective）\n<STRUCT_0004>\n这些二元组按上述严格（strict）等价（equivalence）取类。此外，在这种情形下，所有拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）<MATH_0016>均为可逆的（invertible）<MATH_0017>-模（modules），且乘法映射（maps）诱导同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0018>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra homomorphism", "target_term": "代数同态"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理开头给定的基概形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰构成层的模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "构成拟凝聚层的分次对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "满足所给代数生成条件的层"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "陈述生成条件时使用的结构"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "所给层作为代数满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "表示所述函子的概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "给定基底上的概形到二元组集合的对应"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "函子的输入"}, {"source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "函子所分类的对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "函子的取值"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的", "context": "对二元组第一项的性质要求"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "二元组第一项的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "对二元组第二项的分次要求"}, {"source_term": "algebra homomorphism", "target_term": "代数同态", "context": "二元组第二项的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "所指定映射的满性要求"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格", "context": "限定取类使用的等价关系"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价", "context": "决定二元组何时归入同一类"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "结论断言均可逆的各层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的", "context": "结论对各个模断言的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所给各层的模结构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "由乘法给出并诱导同构的映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "由乘法映射诱导的同构"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:01O4:proof", "translation": "在引理的假设下，层（sheaves）<MATH_0001>是可逆的（invertible），乘法映射（maps）是同构（isomorphisms）。由引理<REF_0001>和引理<REF_0002>可在<MATH_0002>的仿射开集（affine opens）上得出这些结论。因此，<MATH_0003>确实表示函子（functor）<MATH_0004>，见引理<REF_0003>的证明。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "要验证可逆性的各层"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆的", "context": "各层在引理假设下的性质"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "需要验证为同构的乘法映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "乘法映射在引理假设下的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "应用前两个引理的局部开集"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "由所给对象实际表示的函子"}], "notes": []}
